  "solution": {
    "text": "Here, <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br />But,&nbsp;<math><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mo>(</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br />Which is possible only when<br /><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br />Then, <math><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>"
  }
